    "Kayoi 不收集使用情况或文件内容。检查更新时会连接更新服务，文件只在你的 Mac 和你选择的位置之间传输。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kayoi does not collect usage data or file contents. Checking for updates connects to the update service. Files move only between your Mac and the locations you choose."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kayoi 不收集使用情况或文件内容。检查更新时会连接更新服务，文件只在你的 Mac 和你选择的位置之间传输。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
