    "MD5 指纹用于核对手机上的 USB 调试授权提示；请确认两边一致后再允许。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use the MD5 fingerprint to check the USB debugging authorization prompt on your phone. Confirm that both fingerprints match before allowing access."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MD5 指纹用于核对手机上的 USB 调试授权提示；请确认两边一致后再允许。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
