    "不会。SMB、WebDAV 和 NFS 由系统保持挂载；需要断开时，请在 Kayoi 或 Finder 中推出。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No. The system keeps SMB, WebDAV, and NFS mounted. To disconnect, eject them in Kayoi or Finder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不会。SMB、WebDAV 和 NFS 由系统保持挂载；需要断开时，请在 Kayoi 或 Finder 中推出。"
          }
        }
      }
