    "如果提示设备被占用，请退出其它手机调试工具，再重试；必要时重新启动 Kayoi。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If Kayoi reports that the device is busy, quit other phone debugging tools and try again. Restart Kayoi if needed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果提示设备被占用，请退出其它手机调试工具，再重试；必要时重新启动 Kayoi。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果服务商要求验证，请先在服务商页面完成验证，再回到 Kayoi 重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the provider requires verification, complete it on the provider’s page, then return to Kayoi and try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果服务商要求验证，请先在服务商页面完成验证，再回到 Kayoi 重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果服务提供应用密码，请使用应用密码而不是网页登录密码。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the service offers app passwords, use one instead of your web sign-in password."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果服务提供应用密码，请使用应用密码而不是网页登录密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果未能识别账号，请展开“其他登录方式”，按说明复制并粘贴登录信息，再验证并保存。不要把登录信息发给其他人。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the account is not recognized, expand “Other Sign-In Methods” and follow the instructions to copy and paste your sign-in information. Then verify and save. Do not share the information with anyone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果未能识别账号，请展开“其他登录方式”，按说明复制并粘贴登录信息，再验证并保存。不要把登录信息发给其他人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果相机询问是否允许访问，请先在相机上确认，再回到 Kayoi 测试连接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
