    "小米、OPPO、vivo 和三星手机的开关位置可能不同。请在设置中搜索“USB 调试”，并确认厂商的安全设置允许 USB 调试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The settings may be in different places on Xiaomi, OPPO, vivo, and Samsung phones. Search for “USB debugging” and check that the manufacturer’s security settings allow it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小米、OPPO、vivo 和三星手机的开关位置可能不同。请在设置中搜索“USB 调试”，并确认厂商的安全设置允许 USB 调试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "小米、OPPO、vivo、三星的入口可能不同，可在手机设置中搜索“开发者选项”和“USB 调试”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The settings may be in different places on Xiaomi, OPPO, vivo, and Samsung phones. Search your phone’s settings for “Developer Options” and “USB debugging”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小米、OPPO、vivo、三星的入口可能不同，可在手机设置中搜索“开发者选项”和“USB 调试”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
