    "蓝奏云位置只能读取和下载，不能上传、改名、移动或删除文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lanzou Cloud locations support only reading and downloading. You cannot upload, rename, move, or delete files."
