          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请打开相机，使用数据线连接 Mac，并在相机上选择 PTP 或图像传输模式。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on the camera, connect it to your Mac by cable, and select PTP or image transfer mode on the camera."
          }
