          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请核对存储桶所在区域、地址格式和密钥权限。服务地址应来自服务商控制台，而不是存储桶的网页管理链接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check the bucket’s region, address format, and key permissions. Use the endpoint from the provider’s console, not the bucket’s web management URL."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请核对存储桶所在区域、地址格式和密钥权限。服务地址应来自服务商控制台，而不是存储桶的网页管理链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请检查网络和登录信息，然后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check your network and sign-in information, then try again."
          }
        },
