    "请让手机和 Mac 连接同一 Wi-Fi，在手机的无线调试设置中打开“使用配对码配对设备”，并保持该页面开启。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect your phone and Mac to the same Wi-Fi network. Open “Pair device with pairing code” in your phone’s Wireless Debugging settings and keep that page open."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请让手机和 Mac 连接同一 Wi-Fi，在手机的无线调试设置中打开“使用配对码配对设备”，并保持该页面开启。"
          }
